OL,6,     FRick discovers Europe's largest
OL,7,     Ftea plantation on the banks of the
OL,8,     FRiver Fal, bakes a simple yet
OL,9,     Fsumptuous fruited tea loaf, and
OL,10,     Ffinds out how Cornwall inspired
OL,11,     FCharles Dickens.
OL,12,G1835 Rick Stein's Cornwall
OL,13,     FRick soaks up the ambience at one
OL,14,     Fof the UK's last live cattle
OL,15,     Fmarkets, is in the mood for steak
OL,16,     Fand kidney pudding, and sets sail
OL,17,     Fout of Falmouth in a hand-built
OL,18,     Fboat.
